{"title": "Swift Strides", "pageid": 28424, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Swift_Strides", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Swift Strides</b> is a passive feature that increases the user's movement speed whenever they dash.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When the wearer <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/25px-Dash_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/38px-Dash_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/50px-Dash_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dashes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/25px-Dash_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\">Dashes</a> or takes a similar action during combat, they gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Momentum_(Condition)\" title=\"Momentum (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Momentum\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Momentum_(Condition)\" title=\"Momentum (Condition)\">Momentum</a> for 3 turns. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Momentum\"> Condition: Momentum </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Momentum_(Condition)\" title=\"Momentum (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Momentum\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Momentum_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Momentum_(Condition)\" title=\"Momentum (Condition)\">Momentum</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 3  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Spurred on by a sense of urgency. <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a> increased by 1.5 m (5 ft) per remaining duration of this effect.</li>\n<li>Removed when <a href=\"/wiki/Restrained_(Condition)\" title=\"Restrained (Condition)\">Restrained</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Incapacitated\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(status_group)\" title=\"Incapacitated (status group)\">Incapacitated</a></span>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(status_group)\" title=\"Prone (status group)\">Prone</a></span>, or slowed down.</li>\n<li><b>Momentum</b> has a maximum <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 5 turns.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Springstep_Boots\" title=\"Springstep Boots\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a6/Springstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Springstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a6/Springstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Springstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a6/Springstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Springstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a6/Springstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Springstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a6/Springstep_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Springstep_Boots\" title=\"Springstep Boots\">Springstep Boots</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cunning_Action:_Dash\" title=\"Cunning Action: Dash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp/20px-Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp/30px-Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp/40px-Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cunning Action: Dash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp/20px-Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Dash_bonus_action_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cunning_Action:_Dash\" title=\"Cunning Action: Dash\">Cunning Action: Dash</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Step_of_the_Wind:_Dash\" title=\"Step of the Wind: Dash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp/20px-Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp/30px-Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp/40px-Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Step of the Wind: Dash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp/20px-Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Step_of_the_Wind_Dash_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source 